の修正とほぼ同じ理由によるものです。　通期の業績予想につきましては、中間連結会計期間の業績を勘案し。連結予想および個別予想を修正いたします。※上記の業績予想につきましては、現時点で入手可能な情報に基づき作成したものであり、実際の業績は様々な不確定要素がございますので、予想数値と異なる場合があります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "（2026年５月12日発表）", null, "CurrentYearInstant_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 20, "20.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 20, "20.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "2027年３月期の期末配当につきましては、当初１株につき20円00銭としておりましたが、通期の業績予想が大幅に未達となったことから、誠に遺憾ではございますが、無配に修正させていただきたいと存じます。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "Fis